{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the demo version of the fun and casual third-person shooter game &quot;Suishou Attribute 2&quot;. The demo includes all the core mechanics of the game: not only can you defeat opponents with weapons, but your bullets can also <strong>modify the properties of almost all objects in the scene, including players</strong>, helping you turn the tide in battle mode or find the exit in challenge mode! At the same time, in battle mode, you can also <strong>accumulate card draw opportunities, collect cards to unlock various buffs and skills</strong>, defining your unique playstyle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting Shooting:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features the same lock-on auto-aim system as the full version, allowing you to shoot freely without careful aiming! Ensuring every player starts fairly and enjoys the game to the fullest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/30602e663974c216afd877e5e0e6d2db.poster.avif?t=1759319212\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/30602e663974c216afd877e5e0e6d2db.webm?t=1759319212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attribute Adjustment:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo provides 6 types of attribute bullets: Health, Size, Voltage, Copy-Paste, Position, and Rotation bullets. Modify any object on the map (including enemies and yourself) to create tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/a204fc2d288297440cade9a87ae403bc.poster.avif?t=1759319212\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/a204fc2d288297440cade9a87ae403bc.webm?t=1759319212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/f537435220d94b0c856685ebbb938d66.poster.avif?t=1759319212\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/f537435220d94b0c856685ebbb938d66.webm?t=1759319212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scene Adjustment:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, create, and copy objects and buildings in the scene to build your own defensive fortress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/d9338588fce1ca44b4b9651843e6d778.poster.avif?t=1759319212\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/d9338588fce1ca44b4b9651843e6d778.webm?t=1759319212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Card Upgrade:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo provides 28 buff cards. Obtain cards through battles, unlock buffs and skills, and develop your unique build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/d970a850b1f83e744915cbb998022d22.poster.avif?t=1759319212\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/d970a850b1f83e744915cbb998022d22.webm?t=1759319212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single Player Challenge:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a fan of PvP? The game also offers a brain-teasing challenge mode! The demo includes 3.5 levels. Use attribute adjustments to solve puzzles and race against players worldwide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/df2f18e04f10cc9ddd41ec25e30930a4.poster.avif?t=1759319212\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/df2f18e04f10cc9ddd41ec25e30930a4.webm?t=1759319212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982590?t=1759319212","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982590?t=1759319212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/4130f471717a93ac5cdc9360842f6fd934385ef6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759319212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/4130f471717a93ac5cdc9360842f6fd934385ef6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759319212","categories":[{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the demo version of the fun and casual third-person shooter game &quot;Suishou Attribute 2&quot;. The demo includes all the core mechanics of the game: not only can you defeat opponents with weapons, but your bullets can also <strong>modify the properties of almost all objects in the scene, including players</strong>, helping you turn the tide in battle mode or find the exit in challenge mode! At the same time, in battle mode, you can also <strong>accumulate card draw opportunities, collect cards to unlock various buffs and skills</strong>, defining your unique playstyle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting Shooting:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features the same lock-on auto-aim system as the full version, allowing you to shoot freely without careful aiming! Ensuring every player starts fairly and enjoys the game to the fullest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/30602e663974c216afd877e5e0e6d2db.poster.avif?t=1759319212\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/30602e663974c216afd877e5e0e6d2db.webm?t=1759319212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attribute Adjustment:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo provides 6 types of attribute bullets: Health, Size, Voltage, Copy-Paste, Position, and Rotation bullets. Modify any object on the map (including enemies and yourself) to create tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/a204fc2d288297440cade9a87ae403bc.poster.avif?t=1759319212\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/extras/a204fc2d288297440cade9a87ae403bc.webm?t=1759319212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop pla