9319212"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/bc5330a8c8069ce8c8069dc0d1c34da8158c528f/ss_bc5330a8c8069ce8c8069dc0d1c34da8158c528f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759319212","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982590/bc5330a8c8069ce8c8069dc0d1c34da8158c528f/ss_bc5330a8c8069ce8c8069dc0d1c34da8158c528f.600x338.jpg?t=1759319212"}],"short_description":"This is a fun casual multiplayer battle game. Bullets not only defeat opponents but also alter the properties of objects and even players, turning the tide or finding the exit! Collect cards for boosts and skills, shape your playstyle, and enjoy diverse maps, modes, characters, and weapons.","steam_appid":3982590,"support_info":{"email":"Attributeofficial@outlook.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","type":"demo","website":null}